;            +Model Formula:  Y = ( B1 +B4*X2+B5*X3+B6*X4+B7*X5+B8*X6+B9*X7 ) * ( X1 - B0 )^B2 * EXP( B3 * ( X1 - B0 ) )
;                -Where: Y=h_mervol,X1=plotage,X2=dm_er1,X3=dm_er2,X4=dm_sc1,X5=dm_sc2,X6=dm_cc1,X7=dm_cc2
;            +Parameter Values: 
;                -B1 = 20.000000|©;-B2 = 0.085635|®;-B3 = 1.989590|©
