;                -Where: Y=t_mervol,X1=plotage,X2=dm_er1,X3=dm_er2,X4=dm_sc1,X5=dm_sc2,X6=dm_cc1,X7=dm_cc2
;            +Parameter Values: 
;                -B1 = 20.000000|©;-B2 = 0.910648|®;-B3 = 1.762000|©
;                -B4 = -0.029433|©;-B5 = 0.002547|®;-B6 = -0.077494|®
;                -B7 = -0.308668|®;-B8 = -0.488466|®;-B9 = 0.031261|®
;                -B10 = -0.105576|®
;    -Component Mapping:  
;        >White Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Spruce * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Black Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Black Spruce * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Balsam Fir: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Balsam Fir * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >White Pine: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Pine * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Tamarack Larch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Tamarack Larch * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Red Maple: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Red Maple * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >White Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Trembling Aspen: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Trembling Aspen * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
